          "Id": "vernon_001",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "You. Take these.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            },
            {
              "Text": "His outstretched hand offers you the two objects: One a small pill-sized object with electrical connectors poking from the sides, and the other some fashion of scan and input device. He pulls another object from his pocket with his free hand, a strangely green metallic tube. He waits for you to follow his instructions.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:33.685 Unknown2=0 then 1",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_001_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Fine, I will hold the items for you.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:33.6858725Z",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_002",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_001_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:33.6858725Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_001_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_002",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "As you take the two objects in-hand the man begins running his fingers along the tube, pressing at various points on its featureless, smooth surface. As he works a glow begins eminating from within, steadily growing brighter and brighter. After a moment he pauses and looks up to you for the first time, an expectant expression on his face.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "... Well?",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:35.672 Unknown2=1 then 0 (capture spelling eminating)",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_002_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "... well what?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:35.6736466Z; Answer=0 → grant tools + Hacking Skills",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_003",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_002_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:35.6736466Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_002_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_003",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "Well get to it!",
              "Unknown2": 0
            },
            {
              "Text": "He seems less than pleased that you haven't done... whatever it is he wanted you to do by now.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "The little thing is an Omni-Tek Technical Library. The scope thing is a Hacker Tool. I want the Library hacked because that will remove that absolutely moronic \"Omni-Tek Employee Lock\" on the damnable thing. Just use the tool on the library and get back to me when you're done.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            },
            {
              "Text": "With that he returns his attention to the glowing tube.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:37.800 Unknown2=0/1/0/1",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_003_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I'm done now.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:37.8003348Z",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_hack_first",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_003_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:37.8003348Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_003_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_hack_first",
          "PromptText": "Are you now...",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:45.435 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_first_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I was able to hack the device.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:45.4356263Z; Answer=0 → StartTrade",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_hack_trade",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_first_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "On second thought, I need some more time.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:45.4356263Z",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_more_time",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_first_option_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:45.4356263Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_hack_first_option_2_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_more_time",
          "PromptText": "I thought so.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:49.919 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_more_time_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:49.9208602Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_more_time_option_0_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_hack_offer",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "The man's head barely even tilts upward as you approach, keeping his focus on the odd objects in his hands.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "Well?",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:54.632 Unknown2=1 then 0 (has library reopen)",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_offer_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I was able to hack the device.",
