              "NextNodeId": "vernon_hack_trade",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_offer_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:50:54.6339545Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_hack_offer_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_hack_trade",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "Without even blinking an eye the man continues to poke at the tube in his hands, nodding impassively.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "Very well, leave it here if you would.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:50:56.956 Unknown2=1 then 0 then StartTrade",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_hack_trade_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "(Continue after trade)",
              "TextEvidence": "Synthetic; post RejectedItems → AnswerList Is this legal?",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_after_hack_turnin",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin",
          "PromptText": "Well then, you seem like you are the useful kind of stray dog. Don't tell me, you are here to get my help with an ID card, but I won't do it for free. I have a simple task, and you'll need that Hacker Tool again. In the dock area, there's a Shipping Manifest Terminal. I need that terminal... altered. You can either go in via the freight entrance or the personnel entrance. Either way is up to you. Once you're in, find the terminal and use your Hacker Tool on it to reroute some of the data over to one of my... organization's own databases. Fairly simple, and once you're done I should be able to give you a hand. \\nDo you have any questions?",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:51:01.838 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Is this... legal?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:51:01.8389648Z",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_after_hack_legal",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Nope.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:51:01.8389648Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin_option_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:51:01.8389648Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_after_hack_turnin_option_2_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_after_hack_legal",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "Technically speaking, no. But neither is getting a fake ID.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            },
            {
              "Text": "With that the man nods and returns his attention to the glowing green tube nearby, seemingly forgetting about your presence once more. You suppose question and answer time is over...",
              "Unknown2": 1
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-214957 19:51:08.504 Unknown2=0 then 1",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_after_hack_legal_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T19:51:08.5048571Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_after_hack_legal_option_0_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_return_001",
          "PromptText": "And you finally return. I was starting to think I'd have to head on over to the docks and fish you out of some trouble.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-224911 20:49:16.761 Unknown2=0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_return_001_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I've returned. The terminal was hacked.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T20:49:16.7896757Z; Answer=0 → AppendText then StartTrade",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_return_trade",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_return_001_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T20:49:16.7896757Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "vernon_return_001_option_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Safe close"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_return_trade",
          "PromptText": "Good. You should have an ID chip of some fashion. Give it here.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-224911 20:49:18.791 Unknown2=0 then StartTrade",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_return_trade_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "(Continue after trade)",
              "TextEvidence": "Synthetic; post RejectedItems → AnswerList Great!/Goodbye",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_return_002",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "vernon_return_002",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "You procure the chip from your pocket, the man quickly snatching it from your grip. He produces his own hacker tool and sets to work, holding the scope end over the small chip as he taps against the interface display. After only a few seconds he nods again and hands it to you once more.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "There. I've programmed your chip with official ICC clearance codes. Same as if you'd gotten them from a bureaucrat yourself. You'll need that for authentication purposes. Doctor Mason over at the hospital can help you out with imprinting your DNA in to the chip.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-224911 20:49:27.056 Unknown2=1 then 0",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "vernon_return_002_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Great! Anything else?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T20:49:27.0593422Z",
              "NextNodeId": "vernon_return_003",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "vernon_return_002_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T20:49:27.0593422Z",
              "NextNodeId": "close",
              "Actions": [
